     3143         b1-Ostatok-end   [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" @  F-Ostatok-end
     3144         b1-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3145         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3146                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3147                   End.
     3148      WHEN "B2":U  Then  DO:
     3149       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     3150         p3 @ s-bar-code
