     3197         bo-Ostatok-end   [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" @  F-Ostatok-end
     3198         bo-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3199         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3200                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3201                 End.
     3202      WHEN ""  Then  DO:
