     3244         b1-Ostatok-end   [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Ostatok-end
     3245         b1-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3246         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3247   if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     3248     p3 CHR(9)
     3249     p4 CHR(9)
     3250     gds-zap-gds-name CHR(9)
     3251     p6 CHR(9)
     3252     gds-zap-type     CHR(9)
